{"pid":"f15d931b-76a9-4334-b45b-2f8e6ef0ffc2","pos":[-1013.275,0.236,-0.914],"name":"Shop","layer":"npc","npcId":2604,"label":"Vending Machine","npcType":"Npc","does":[]},{"pid":"07d3ace2-5943-4d8b-ab4b-1b8f13b63673","pos":[7.647,1.249,-23.594],"name":"Story 1","layer":"npc","npcId":2597,"label":"Bar Table","npcType":"Npc","does":[]},{"pid":"592c1194-847e-4e25-b544-26627d6ccc3c","pos":[-988.593,1.249,-13.604],"name":"Story 2 OFF","layer":"npc","npcId":2598,"label":"Lobby Table","npcType":"Npc","does":[],"vis":"1111111111100000000000"},{"pid":"c29f7553-17e8-46b6-8a18-72a63975aa81","pos":[-988.593,1.249,-13.604],"name":"Story 2 ON","layer":"npc","npcId":2599,"label":"Lobby Table","npcType":"Npc","does":[],"vis":"0000000000011111111111"},{"pid":"8a6f7152-bb58-41d0-b1dd-e0fa70d72a4f","pos":[-14.79,0.03,18.68],"name":"NPCTalk 01","layer":"npc","npcId":2684,"talk":[["Student with a Ponytail","Did you hear? Apparently someone in the classroom next to ours lost consciousness!"],["Student with Short Hair","Seriously? That's terrible. Don't we have tests coming up?"],["Student with a Ponytail","What if I suddenly fall unconscious? It's so scary..."],["Student with Short Hair","They should really just close the school for a while..."],["","The students seem anxious..."]],"label":"NPC 7033003","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"1111100000000000000000"},{"pid":"4d13a3f6-bd54-466b-a842-719d7aec2400","pos":[-38.36,0.24,20.04],"name":"NPCTalk 02","layer":"npc","npcId":2685,"talk":[["Shady Man","Hey. Hey, you! Yes, you."],["Shady Man","I can tell from that gloomy look on your face that you're worried about catching that disease that's going around. Right?"],["Shady Man","I just so happen to have a rare supplement obtained from the surface. You interested? A single pill of this miracle drug could make even an old granny spring to her feet."],["Shady Man","And you're in luck! As a bonus, I'll give you a pill that makes you more attrac... Hey! Don't ignore me!"]],"label":"NPC 7033001","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"1111100000000000000000"},{"pid":"b8eec317-2488-46db-9fcf-e95928760474","pos":[-13.98,0.56,-45.31],"name":"NPCTalk 03","layer":"npc","npcId":2686,"talk":[["Suspicious Citizen","The news keeps talking about monsters and stuff, but I'm not so sure."],["Suspicious Citizen","I think there's a poison gas leak somewhere in the Ark, and the reason people are suddenly passing out is because they inhaled the gas."],["Suspicious Citizen","Wait, I can't just sit around here... I need to go buy a gas mask."],["Suspicious Citizen","... I don't want to die."],["","Anxiety is starting to spread..."]],"label":"NPC 7033002","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0000011111111111111111"},{"pid":"a41e217c-aa07-4f1d-b3ab-437ebd19e565","pos":[19.85,1.4,-32.59],"name":"NPCTalk 04","layer":"npc","npcId":2687,"talk":[["","People are discussing how to protect the Ark..."]],"label":"NPC 7033023","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0000010000000000000000"},{"pid":"2533e7a1-3cf9-4d85-9e15-d2ed1d7763c2","pos":[-3.74,1.465,-26.52],"name":"NPCTalk 05","layer":"npc","npcId":2688,"label":"NPC 7029018","npcType":"Npc","does":[],"vis":"0000001111111111111111"},{"pid":"69284cfd-040b-4d6d-ad85-4d1b67745bb1","pos":[-3.74,1.79,-26.39],"name":"NPCTalk 05(999999)","layer":"npc","npcId":2689,"talk":[["Calm Citizen","I could fall unconscious tomorrow, but I'm still gonna go to the Maid Cafe today."],["Calm Citizen","I need to see Soda and that smile of hers. She just glows! She's the cutest, prettiest, hottest maid in the whole Ark!"],["Calm Citizen","Ahhh... Just picturing her smile is giving me strength!"],["Calm Citizen","If I do fall unconscious, make sure you tell Soda. I bet hearing her voice will wake me right up."]],"label":"NPC 7033022","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0000001111111111111111"},{"pid":"f7e10790-746c-4d40-a1f3-5b7a7c8cc57b","pos":[-38.36,0.24,20.04],"name":"NPCTalk 06","layer":"npc","npcId":2690,"talk":[["Shady Man","This is your last chance! It'll be too late once you fall unconscious! Take this drug from the surface and improve your stamina, brainpower, and immunity! It'll give you energy and improve your sight!"],["Shady Man","If you're curious about the price, just ask! ... What, you're not interested? You gonna buy some or not?"],["Shady Man","Just so you know, it's almost sold out. There might not be any left next time you come by!"],["Shady Man","If you don't have any money, then go earn some and come back. I'll give you a special deal, just for you."]],"label":"NPC 7033001","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0011000000000000000000"},{"pid":"abbdad5a-009c-44d8-ac9f-9ebf54e5826e","pos":[-14.79,0.03,18.68],"name":"NPCTalk 07","layer":"npc","npcId":2691,"talk":[["Student with a Ponytail","Are you okay? Why're you so late? You didn't answer any of my calls...! I thought you'd fallen unconscious!"],["Student with Short Hair","Sorry! I thought that only happened to frail people, though. I'm mentally and physically fit, so I'll be fine."],["Student with a Ponytail","You don't know that. The news said you just pass out. It's got me really scared, so start answering my calls."],["Student with Short Hair","Okay, okay. I will. Anyway, wanna go to the Maid Cafe? I smelled the curry when I walked by, and now I can't stop thinking about it."]],"label":"NPC 7033003","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0011000000000000000000"},{"pid":"f2bf47ec-2c97-4f30-9980-d8f0a5db3950","pos":[-14.79,0.03,18.68],"name":"NPCTalk 08","layer":"npc","npcId":2692,"talk":[["Student with Short Hair","Oh...! Are you okay now? Should you be walking around like this?"],["Student with a Ponytail","Yeah, it just feels like I woke up from a good, long sleep. Were you worried?"],["Student with Short Hair","Yeah, of course I was! I started to think you might not wake up..."],["Student with a Ponytail","I'm totally fine now! And I'm really craving something sweet. Wanna go check out that one place you said you wanted to try?"],["","Peace has returned to the Ark..."]],"label":"NPC 7033003","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0000000111110000000000"},{"pid":"fa9e23a9-7b35-48e5-bc56-c4ffae883d61","pos":[-7.16,0,13.62],"name":"NPCTalk 09 leona","layer":"npc","npcId":2694,"label":"NPC 7033018","npcType":"Npc","does":[],"vis":"0000000000000010000000"},{"pid":"3c293954-ce53-49c1-99ca-45d61f1b1927","pos":[-9.95,0,13.1],"name":"NPCTalk 09 poli","layer":"npc","npcId":2693,"label":"Character 30","npcType":"Character","icon":"icons-char/si_c030_00_s","does":[],"vis":"0000000000000010000000"},{"pid":"f8a5c349-1296-43f7-bac0-21d735928afd","pos":[-7.44,0.035,12.45],"name":"NPCTalk 09 timi","layer":"npc","npcId":2695,"label":"NPC 7033020","npcType":"Npc","does":[],"vis":"0000000000000010000000"},{"pid":"ce9f3b9b-36a4-4d66-93d1-be5dbc9fa551","pos":[-7.39,0,13.94],"name":"NPCTalk 09(999999)","layer":"npc","npcId":2696,"talk":[["Poli","Do you know why I stopped you?"],["Leona","... I have no idea."],["Timi","Graauul."],["Poli","You were going eighty while riding on Timi's back. If you had hit a pedestrian, they could've gotten seriously hurt!"],["Leona","Oh, you don't worry have to about that. Timi has excellent reflexes..."],["Poli","Is that really your defense?!"],["Timi","Graaaul..."],["Leona","I'm sorry..."]],"label":"NPC 7033023","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0000000000000010000000"},{"pid":"52b36777-0a5a-4fda-b4bd-643dbf2bfbc0","pos":[39.53,1.344,-25.77],"name":"NPCTalk 10","layer":"npc","npcId":2698,"label":"NPC 7005005","npcType":"Npc","does":[],"vis":"0000000000000000110000"},{"pid":"219be4f6-29eb-4f91-a411-eecac53b4039","pos":[37.6,1.344,-25.5],"name":"NPCTalk 10","layer":"npc","npcId":2697,"label":"NPC 7017001","npcType":"Npc","does":[],"vis":"0000000000000000110000"},{"pid":"3aafea87-6d31-4cae-a836-5a62b8745935","pos":[38.52,1.62,-26.34],"name":"NPCTalk 10(999999)","layer":"npc","npcId":2699,"talk":[["Shopaholic","This Sunday is our last chance."],["Desperate Citizen","Yeah, if we don't manage to get it from the home shopping channel, we'll have to get it used somewhere..."],["Shopaholic","Please connect. Please answer my call, customer service agent!"],["Desperate Citizen","We'll have to be at the ready when the show begins..."]],"label":"NPC 7033023","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0000000000000000110000"},{"pid":"40e78bd3-3f5b-4983-b7c1-d79a00198bb2","pos":[-14.79,0.03,18.68],"name":"NPCTalk 11","layer":"npc","npcId":2700,"talk":[["Student with Short Hair","You traitor! We were up all night texting! When did you study without me?!"],["Student with a Ponytail","I didn't study without you. I'm just that good, hahaha!"],["Student with Short Hair","Hmph...! Fine, just you wait and see next time! I'm gonna get a better score than you!"],["Student with a Ponytail","By all means, try to keep up! Let's study together at a cafe later."]],"label":"NPC 7033003","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0000000000000000001000"},{"pid":"8e9c1b12-7171-4a61-97ba-6626e465fc9d","pos":[-988.72,0.36,-8.207],"name":"NPCTalk 12","layer":"npc","npcId":2701,"talk":[["","People are discussing how to protect the Ark..."]],"label":"NPC 7033023","npcType":"Npc","does":["NPCTalk"],"vis":"0000001111111111111111"},{"pid":"2abeaea2-8d9e-4916-88b0-aafe4c6660dc","pos":[-1.9,1.409,-25.51],"name":"Phase 1 ade","layer":"npc","npcId":2613,"say":[["Ade","Welcome, Master!"],["Ade","The Maid Cafe is holding an event\nwith a classical theme!"]],"label":"Character 310","npcType":"Character","icon":"icons-char/si_c310_00_s","does":[],"vis":"1110000000000000000000"},{"pid":"3efd3cda-a78d-4ff9-87ff-508d1a1c9199","pos":[31.69,0.16,25.19],"name":"Phase 1 citizen 01","layer":"npc","npcId":2610,"label":"NPC 7017002","npcType":"Npc","does":[],"vis":"1110000000000000000000"},{"pid":"e6dcffd2-e404-4448-a0a1-dd78bb5c0a38","pos":[30.86,1.409,-22.28],"name":"Phase 1 citizen 02","layer":"npc","npcId":2611,"say":[["Citizen","Ugh, there aren't any good shows on 